* 11 Sep 26 dm - ADOPT attaches an SD account to a Linux user that ALREADY
*   EXISTS instead of creating one.  PORT_ADOPTION 15, the port's CREATEA of
*   14 and 21 Aug 2026.  See more.args for what gates it.
