       @system.return.code = -ER$ARGS
       stop sysmsg(6052) ;* User name is invalid
          
* 11 Sep 26 dm - PORT_ADOPTION 15.  ***A PRE-EXISTING LINUX USER IS ADOPTED OR
*   REFUSED, NEVER TAKEN SILENTLY.***  Owner's rule, 10 Sep 2026: all SD users
*   are created WITHIN SD, and the ONE exception is the installer's own user,
*   adopted at install time.  These two branches used to say `null` and take
*   the account - so "create.account user <anybody-with-a-login>" quietly
*   attached an SD account to somebody else's existing Linux login.  The port
*   removed the same two branches on 14 Aug 2026 (its CREATEA:483) and its note
